            "review_title": "Review at Heli Vegetarian Bistro",
            "review_text": "Lee N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nEat vegetarian and chill on Heli's rooftop\nSep 2023 • Couples\nThe vegetarian restaurant in the center of Phu Nhuan's bustling dining area has an ideal dating space for chilling and is well worth experiencing!\nQuesadilla with Tomyum Soup is extremely delicious and also unique in flavor when using only vegetables and fruits 😍 Give the kitchen here 10 points. The atmosphere here also makes me excited in every little corner. Cute and cheerful staff. I will definitely bring my family here to try again 🫶\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 1, 2023",
