            "review_title": "Review at Heli Vegetarian Bistro",
            "review_text": "Dzung L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n1\nGood vegan restaurant\nAug 2023 • Family\nDelicious vegetarian dishes beautifully presented. Especially the brown rice wrapped in lotus leaves, the rolls of all kinds have their own dipping sauce for each type so you don't get bored eating them..\nWalking past the kitchen, I saw it was clean and the staff were friendly. Will recommend to friends and relatives to visit. An ideal Vegetarian restaurant for healthy, healthy meetings and gatherings 👍\n\nThis restaurant having delicious vegan food, good taste, good services and friendly staff, is a good place to meet friends and family. A must-try vegetarian restaurant in Saigon!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten October 17, 2023\nHeli Vegetarian Bistro\nHeli cảm ơn anh vì những đánh giá tích cực này ạ. Hẹn gặp anh cùng những trải nghiệm tuyệt vời hơn nữa tại Heli sắp tới!\nThank you for your good feedback.We look forward to welcoming you in the future at Heli Vegetarian Bistro.\nRead more\nWritten October 17, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
